@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>Privacy Policy for Personal-Sumguard</p>
<p>Last updated: Ongoing</p>

<p>What data the app collects</p>

<p>Account details — email address and username, if you create an account.</p>

<p>Usage data — how you use the app (e.g. screens visited, features used).</p>

<p>Device data — device type, OS version, and app version.</p>

<p>Crash reports — technical logs if the app crashes.</p>

<p>Anything you enter into the app — e.g. [notes, settings, content you create].</p>

<p>I don't collect anything else, and I don't collect sensitive data (like health, religion, or biometrics).</p>

